  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DROPPED-MX Shade Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project concerns the organization and implementation of a carbon sequestration market, based on land use carbon generated through improvements in certified shade and organic coffee systems.  The project location would be in the uplands of Mexico in areas mostly populated by indigenous communities.  The project would facilitate the transition of small and medium coffee-planters toward land use systems with higher potential to be sustained, while enhancing rural development impacts.</narrative>
  </description>
